    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's just exhausting. pretending to look for a \"spark\" when everything is just... heavy. Like, why do i have to keep fighting for a life that's already been broken? stayin' feels like a chore, honestly. i just want to stop feeling this weight. wouldn't it be easier to just let it all go? to just find some kind of peace and stop the fighting? what do you think? is it really worth the struggle if the end result is always just more pain?",
